WEBVTT

00:05:59.981 --> 00:06:03.681
we are able to stay with the lions without any conflict.

00:06:03.681 --> 00:06:06.901
Ashê olên. It means in my language, thank you very much.

00:06:06.901 --> 00:06:17.801
(Applause)

00:06:21.381 --> 00:06:23.682
Chris Anderson: You have no idea how exciting it is

00:06:23.682 --> 00:06:25.793
to hear a story like yours.

00:06:25.793 --> 00:06:27.829
So you got this scholarship.Richard Turere: Yep.

00:06:27.829 --> 00:06:30.406
CA: You're working on other electrical inventions.